
                  DayDream BBS V1.00, ExternalCommands.DAT
                  ----------------------------------------

OFFSET  TYPE     LENGTH  DESCRIPTION                                     FLAGS
==============================================================================
 0000   STRING     10    EXTERNAL COMMAND NAME                             (-)
 0011   BYTE       01    EXTERNAL COMMAND TYPE (SEE TABLE BELOW)           (-)
 0012   BYTE       01    SECURITY LEVEL REQUIRED TO RUN THIS COMMAND       (-)
 0013   STRING     86    COMMAND TO _LVOExecute() WHEN EXPECTED TO RUN     (-)
 0100   FREE BLOCK 100   FREE SPACE RESERVED FOR FUTURE DEVELOPMENT        (-)
 0200   -- END --  00    TOTAL LENGTH: 200 BYTES                           (-)
==============================================================================

