Available External Command Types | Value | Command Type       |
                                 +-------+--------------------+
                                 | 00000 | DOS Program        |
                                 | 00001 | DayDream Door      |
                                 | 00002 | Paragon Door       |
				 | 00003 | DOS Door           |
